key_decisions | hasValue | Cold-reader proof report as non-authoritative inspection surface rather than executable layer — prevents encoding implementation assumptions as facts; preserves all non-claims.
key_decisions | hasValue | Exactly five closed-enum case classes (evidence-present, no-answer, candidate-only, unresolved-reference, non-authoritative) rather than open-ended categories — closed-enum semantics enable deterministic test assertions.
key_decisions | hasValue | Separate --write (freshness=not-checked) and --check (emits actual freshness) as independent CLI modes — enables CI pipelines to run generation and verification steps independently.
key_decisions | hasValue | Standalone evaluator CLI (evaluate-parser-golden-cases.py) without modifying generator functions — avoids coupling, enables independent fail-closed behavior test coverage.
